371 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/BS<</W 0>>/F 4/FT/Btn/Ff 65536/MK<</BC[0 0 0 0]>>/P 195 0 R/Rect[85.2 460.40397 510.47999 756.80398]/T(Figure4)/TU(Diagram of an autoencoder-based feature extraction block and classification head. The feature extraction block consists of sequential convolution, ReLU, flattening, and linear layers forming an encoder, with corresponding decoder layers. Embeddings from four features are concatenated and fed into a linear classifier with a sigmoid function to produce a label. Option for sequential stacking with aggregation is indicated.)>>
endobj

372 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/BS<</W 0>>/F 4/FT/Btn/Ff 65536/MK<</BC[0 0 0 0]>>/P 195 0 R/Rect[63.528 258.48 276.168 387.12004]/T(Figure5)/TU(Line graph comparing training and validation loss for stacked and autoencoder models over 20 epochs. Both models show decreasing loss, with the stacked model starting higher but converging closer to the autoencoder model by epoch twenty.)>>
endobj

