394 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/BS<</W 0>>/F 4/FT/Btn/Ff 65536/MK<</BC[0 0 0 0]>>/P 197 0 R/Rect[63.699 224.94596 531.399 458.52598]/T(Figure7)/TU(Four heat maps illustrate the ratio of predicted SCS hazardous to total days across a geographic region for March, April, May, and June in 2035. Blue shades represent lower ratios, and red shades represent higher ratios, with March and April showing mostly blue while May and June show more red in certain areas, indicating increased hazard ratio in late spring. A vertical color bar legend explains the color gradient  from blue \(low\) to red \(high\). Each month is labeled below its respective map.)>>
endobj

